l.Get_TouchPadMode())\"\n\nWrite-Host \"`n=== 1. Hardware ACPI Touchpad ON ===\"\n$retAcpi = $acpi.SetMethod2(0x30, 0)\nWrite-Host \"Set ACPI 0x30 to 0 (Enabled): $retAcpi\"\n\nWrite-Host \"`n=== 2. Update LG OSD Registry ===\"\n$osdPath = 'HKCU:\\Software\\LGE\\OSD'\nif (-not (Test-Path $osdPath)) {\n    New-Item -Path $osdPath -Force | Out-Null\n}\nSet-ItemProperty -Path $osdPath -Name 'Touchpad' -Value 0 -Type DWord\nWrite-Host \"HKCU\\Software\\LGE\\OSD Touchpad set to 0 (On)\"\n\nWrite-Host \"`n=== 3. Update Windows Precision Touchpad Registry ===\"\n$ptpStatusPath = 'HKCU:\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\PrecisionTouchPad\\Status'\nif (-not (Test-Path $ptpStatusPath)) {\n    New-Item -Path $ptpStatusPath -Force | Out-Null\n}\nSet-ItemProperty -Path $ptpStatusPath -Name 'Enabled' -Value 1 -Type DWord\n\n$ptpPath = 'HKCU:\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\PrecisionTouchPad'\nif (-not (Test-Path $ptpPath)) {\n    New-Item -Path $ptpPath -Force | Out-Null\n}\nSet-ItemProperty -Path $ptpPath -Name 'LeaveOnWithMouse' -Value 1 -Type DWord\nWrite-Host \"Windows Precision Touchpad Enabled=1, LeaveOnWithMouse=1\"\n\nWrite-Host \"`n=== 4. Notify LG Hotkey Manager ===\"\n$fireMethod = [LGDeviceCtrlLib.LGDeviceController].GetMethod('Fire_TouchPadChanged', [Reflection.BindingFlags]'NonPublic,Instance')\nif ($fireMethod) {\n    $fireMethod.Invoke($ctrl, @())\n    Write-Host \"Fired TouchPadChanged to Hotkey Manager\"\n}\n\nWrite-Host \"`n=== Verification ===\"\nWrite-Host \"ACPI 0x30: $($acpi.GetMethod2(0x30))\"\nWrite-Host \"TouchPadMode: $($ctrl.Get_TouchPadMode())\"\nWrite-Host \"LG OSD Touchpad Reg: $((Get-ItemProperty $osdPath).Touchpad)\"\nWrite-Host \"PTP Enabled Reg: $((Get-ItemProperty $ptpStatusPath).Enabled)\"\nWrite-Host \"PTP LeaveOnWithMouse Reg: $((Get-ItemProperty $ptpPath).LeaveOnWithMouse)\"\n","Description":"Enable and synchronize Touchpad across ACPI, LG OSD, Windows Settings, and Hotkey Manager","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\211c437a-15bb-44af-a76a-d6654c8fc8c3\\scratch\\fix_touchpad.ps1","toolAction":"Writing complete fix script","toolSummary":"Touchpad fix script"}}]}
